# Envoy recibe gRPC-Web por HTTP/1.1 (lo único que Render acepta desde internet) y lo traduce a gRPC
# nativo hacia grpcio en el mismo contenedor. entrypoint.sh reemplaza los __PUERTOS__.
static_resources:
  listeners:
    - name: grpc_web
      address:
        socket_address: { address: 0.0.0.0, port_value: __LISTEN_PORT__ }
      filter_chains:
        - filters:
            - name: envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager
              typed_config:
                "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.network.http_connection_manager.v3.HttpConnectionManager
                stat_prefix: grpc_web
                codec_type: AUTO
                route_config:
                  name: backend
                  virtual_hosts:
                    - name: backend
                      domains: ["*"]
                      routes:
                        # El health check de Render; no toca grpcio
                        - match: { path: /healthz }
                          direct_response: { status: 200, body: { inline_string: ok } }
                        # Solo dejo pasar los servicios del contrato; cualquier otra ruta es 404
                        - match: { prefix: /kinesiapp. }
                          route:
                            cluster: grpc_backend
                            # Sin límite de Envoy: cada RPC lleva su propio deadline desde el cliente
                            timeout: 0s
                http_filters:
                  - name: envoy.filters.http.grpc_web
                    typed_config:
                      "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.grpc_web.v3.GrpcWeb
                  - name: envoy.filters.http.router
                    typed_config:
                      "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.router.v3.Router
  clusters:
    - name: grpc_backend
      type: STATIC
      connect_timeout: 1s
      load_assignment:
        cluster_name: grpc_backend
        endpoints:
          - lb_endpoints:
              - endpoint:
                  address:
                    socket_address: { address: 127.0.0.1, port_value: __GRPC_PORT__ }
      typed_extension_protocol_options:
        envoy.extensions.upstreams.http.v3.HttpProtocolOptions:
          "@type": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.upstreams.http.v3.HttpProtocolOptions
          explicit_http_config:
            http2_protocol_options: {}
